  "id": 203983194310264,
  "uuid": "b552c518-6f99-4f12-88ae-7309f426ea72",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "3776371e-e54b-afb1-7c27-5a2236ea3448",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "207c402d-135a-5780-e40d-1efa71f04d50",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Statement has been developed in consultation with all the AKDN agencies including AKU. It is a policy document that frames and articulates AKDN's approach to the environment and climate and thus provides both a directive and guidance for the work that AKU will do in all its efforts. Central to AKDN's path forward is the commitment to net zero carbon operations by 2030, in line with the latest climate science to avoid the worst impacts.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The commitment was made public by Prince Rahim - one of the first times - at AKU's Institute for Global Health and Development's \n      ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "inaugural SDSN Pakistan seminar",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "/news/challenges-of-climate-change-health-and-nutrition-in-pakistan",
                        "uuid": "e68c2ca0-9401-5609-8588-1bd7847e5504",
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "story"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ". \"We want to ensure that in the face of climate change, people not only survive but also thrive,\" he said in a video message.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
